a.fi"},{"lap":1,"text":"Philippe finished the first lap in the lead after only 3m14s at 75.525 km/h average speed, with Zehender behind him, followed by Lepori, Dreyfus, Bouriano, Etancelin","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":12},{"lap":2,"text":"Philippe remained in the lead on the second lap with a lap of 3m11s, 200 meters ahead of Zehender, Lepori and Dreyfus","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":12},{"lap":2,"text":"Bouriano spun his car around on the second lap, damaged his Bugatti and had to retire.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":15},{"lap":5,"text":"Lepori passes Zehender for second at the start of lap five after a close fight.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":7,"text":"Prince Esterh\u00e1zy indeed drove his 2.0 Bugatti very fast but he disappeared on the seventh lap.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":14},{"lap":8,"text":"Dreyfus passes Zehender for third.","q":false,"c":9},{"lap":10,"text":"It was announced that Philippe was now 500 francs richer after he covered the ten laps in 31m57s","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":12},{"lap":15,"text":"Rigal spins near the sea and loses a few laps.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":15,"text":"On the fifteenth lap, Fashion's Amilcar broke a rocker arm in the cylinder head and had to retire.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":13},{"lap":15,"text":"Philippe completed the fifteen laps in 48m15s at an average speed of 70,516 km/h, ahead of Lepori, Dreyfus, Etancelin, Zehender and Ghersi.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":12},{"lap":20,"text":"After twenty laps Philippe was still leading with 1h04m46s but now was only 14 seconds ahead of Lepori","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":30,"text":"Thirty laps were completed by Philippe in 1h36m38s without much change in the order of the other cars.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":12},{"lap":36,"text":"Philippe skids after the bridge, hits a rock and overturns; unhurt, he retires with a broken wheel. Lepori leads.","q":false,"c":12},{"lap":40,"text":"At the end of the fortieth lap, Ghersi retired his Alfa Romeo with a broken clutch and Etancelin disappeared with the same problem on his Bugatti.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":11},{"lap":40,"text":"Dreyfus is second, 2m9s behind Lepori.","q":false,"c":9},{"lap":49,"text":"Lepori pits to refuel; Dreyfus takes the lead.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":50,"text":"Dreyfus spins on the heat-softened asphalt and stops on rocks with broken wheels, out of the race but unhurt.","q":false,"c":9},{"lap":50,"text":"After 50 laps, two thirds of the race, with nine drivers remaining, Lepori continued in the lead in a time of 2h45m46s, ahead of Zehender and Rigal while Scaron headed the small cars.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":60,"text":"Lepori completed 60 laps in 3h19m05s, followed by the Alfa Romeos of Zehender in 3h24m20s and Rigal in 3h25m16s.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":60,"text":"Lepori stopped to refuel but left immediately without refueling.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":61,"text":"On lap 61 Lepori stopped again and left rather quickly.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":63,"text":"Zehender refueled on lap 63 but left without much determination.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":5},{"lap":68,"text":"De Joncy retired on the sixty-eighth lap.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":8},{"lap":75,"text":"Lepori's last lap was a tour of the victor, who was greeted by a huge ovation.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":75,"text":"Lepori wins; Rigal second and 1500 cc winner, Dauvergne third, Scaron fourth and 1100 cc winner.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":75,"text":"Sandri's Maserati, the slowest car in the field, ran out of petrol 100 meters from the finish.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":7}]}